    "- 只读关联分析中的外部后台项目和安装收据不会被自动处理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- External background items and install receipts in the read-only association analysis are not processed automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- 唯讀關聯分析中的外部背景項目和安裝收據不會自動處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 导出本身不会清理、卸载、忽略、扫描或移动任何项目。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Exporting does not clean, uninstall, ignore, scan, or move any items."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- 匯出本身不會清理、解除安裝、忽略、掃描或移動任何項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 应用本体失败时，所有关联残留都会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- If the app bundle fails, all associated leftovers remain untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- App本體失敗時，所有關聯殘留都會保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 执行时应用本体优先移动到废纸篓。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- During execution, the app bundle is moved to the Trash first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- 執行時App本體優先移動到垃圾桶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 扫描后发生变化、越界或包含符号链接的目标会被拒绝。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Targets that change after scanning, cross boundaries, or contain symbolic links are rejected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- 掃描後發生變化、超出範圍或包含符號連結的目標會被拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "- 这份文件只用于人工审阅，不能用于自动重放或重新执行旧计划。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- This file is for human review only. It cannot replay or rerun an old plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- 這份檔案僅供人工審閱，不能用於自動重播或重新執行舊計畫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
