    "Bundle Identifier 无效": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invalid Bundle Identifier"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundle Identifier 無效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bundle Identifier 无法用于本轮关联分析，请查看覆盖记录后重新扫描。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Bundle Identifier cannot be used for association analysis in this run. Review the coverage record, then rescan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundle Identifier 無法用於本輪關聯分析，請查看覆蓋記錄後重新掃描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bundle Identifier 格式不符合固定规则，残留与关联范围已保留为结构化跳过记录。请修复应用元数据后重新扫描。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Bundle Identifier does not meet the fixed format rules. Leftover and association scopes were retained as structured skip records. Correct the app metadata, then rescan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundle Identifier 格式不符合固定規則；殘留項目與關聯範圍已保留為結構化跳過記錄。請修正 App 中繼資料後重新掃描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bundle Identifier 缺失或无效，只能按精确应用路径忽略": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundle Identifier is missing or invalid; only the exact app path can be ignored"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundle Identifier 缺失或無效，只能依精確 App 路徑忽略"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bundle Identifier 缺失或无效，因此只匹配统一格式后与 %@ 完全相等的应用路径；不会扩大到父目录、子目录或相似名称。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Bundle Identifier is missing or invalid, so only the app path exactly matching %@ after normalization is ignored; parent directories, child directories, and similar names are not included."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundle Identifier 缺失或無效，因此只比對正規化後與 %@ 完全相同的 App 路徑；不會擴大至上層目錄、子目錄或相似名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bundle Identifier 非法": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invalid Bundle Identifier"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundle Identifier 非法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
