    "plist/bom 收据名称去除扩展名后命中应用 Bundle Identifier 的点分命名空间；未解析安装所有权。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plist/bom receipt name, without its extension, matches the app Bundle Identifier's dot-separated namespace; installation ownership was not established."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "plist/bom 收據名稱移除副檔名後，符合 App Bundle Identifier 以句點分隔的命名空間；未判定安裝擁有權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "~/Downloads 中的 DMG、PKG、ZIP、XIP、ISO": {
