    "为避免展示不完整或错配结果，本页不会静默补齐收据。冻结计划仍保持不变，也不会自动重放。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To avoid showing incomplete or mismatched results, this page does not silently fill in a receipt. The frozen plan remains unchanged and will not be replayed automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "為避免顯示不完整或錯配的結果，本頁不會靜默補齊收據。凍結計畫保持不變，也不會自動重新執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为避免把损坏或不兼容的数据伪装成空记录，本页不会显示“暂无记录”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To avoid presenting corrupted or incompatible data as empty records, this page does not show “No Records”."
