          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内存以系统内存压力为准，不看占用率；CPU 看持续状态，单次峰值不算异常；磁盘是存储压力，并只读引用空间分析的统计结果。运行时间与核心数不参与健康扣分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Memory is judged by system memory pressure, not usage percentage; CPU is judged by its sustained state — a single spike does not count as an anomaly; disk is judged by storage pressure and only references Space Analysis statistics read-only. Uptime and core count do not factor into the health score."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記憶體以系統記憶體壓力為準，不看佔用率；CPU 看持續狀態，單次峰值不算異常；磁碟是儲存壓力，並只讀引用空間分析的統計結果。運作時間與核心數不參與健康扣分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
