    "判据为卷可用容量比例：≥20%% 充足、10%%–20%% 偏低、<10%% 紧张。空间分析结果只作**只读**引用，不触发扫描。%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Based on the volume's available-capacity ratio: ≥20%% ample, 10%%–20%% low, <10%% tight. Space Analysis results are referenced **read-only** and do not trigger a scan. %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依磁碟區可用容量比例判定：≥20%% 為充足、10%%–20%% 為偏低、<10%% 為緊張。空間分析結果僅供**唯讀**參考，不會觸發掃描。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "判据为电源状态接口读取的电量与充电状态；低电量模式%@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Based on battery level and charging state from the system power interface; Low Power Mode is %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依系統電源介面讀取的電量與充電狀態判定；低耗電模式%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "判据为系统内存压力事实 kern.memorystatus_vm_pressure_level；占用率 %@ 与压缩 %@ 仅作证据，不参与档位判定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The level is based on the system memory pressure fact kern.memorystatus_vm_pressure_level; usage %@ and compression %@ are evidence only and do not determine the level."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等級依據系統記憶體壓力資料 kern.memorystatus_vm_pressure_level 判定；使用率 %@ 與壓縮量 %@ 僅作為證據，不參與等級判定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
