            "value": "取消選擇 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "变化不推断具体应用、用户行为或 Sin Clean 功劳，与清理收据和磁盘可用空间互不对账": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes do not imply any specific app, user action, or Sin Clean credit, and are not reconciled with cleanup receipts or available disk space"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "變化不推斷具體 App、使用者行為或 Sin Clean 功勞，與清理收據和磁碟可用空間互不對賬"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "变化只说明已扫描类别统计的增加或减少，不能据此推断是某个应用产生、您做了什么操作，也不能归功于 Sin Clean 的清理；清理收据的成功容量、磁盘可用空间变化与这里的类别统计是三套独立数字，互不对账。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes only show increases or decreases in scanned category statistics; they cannot be used to infer that a specific app produced them or what actions you took, nor can they be credited to Sin Clean's cleanup; the successful sizes on cleanup receipts, changes in available disk space, and the category statistics here are three independent sets of figures that are not reconciled with one another."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "變化只說明已掃描類別統計的增加或減少，不能據此推斷是某個 App 產生、您做了什麼操作，也不能歸功於 Sin Clean 的清理；清理收據的成功容量、磁碟可用空間變化與這裡的類別統計是三套獨立數字，互不對賬。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "变化数字为已扫描条目的分配大小统计差（硬链接去重后）；%@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change figures are the differences in allocated-size statistics of scanned entries (after hard link deduplication); %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "變化數字為已掃描條目的分配大小統計差（硬連結去重後）；%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "变化记录只保存在本机应用自身的 Application Support 目录，包含：加盐后的匿名范围标识、七个类别各自的容量与条目数、扫描完成时间、覆盖与精度标志、记录格式与规则版本号。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change records are stored only in this app's own Application Support directory on this Mac, and contain: the salted anonymous scope identifier, the size and entry count of each of the seven categories, scan completion time, coverage and precision flags, and the record format and rules version numbers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "變化記錄只儲存在本機 App 自身的 Application Support 目錄，包含：加鹽後的匿名範圍識別碼、七個類別各自的容量與條目數、掃描完成時間、涵蓋與精確度旗標、記錄格式與規則版本號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "变化记录只保存在本机应用自身的 Application Support 目录，包含：加盐后的匿名范围标识、七个类别各自的容量与条目数、扫描完成时间、覆盖与精度标志、记录格式与规则版本号。不保存任何路径、文件名、目录名、应用名或文件清单；不联网、不上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change records are stored only in this app's own Application Support directory on this Mac. They contain: a salted anonymous scope identifier, the size and item count of each of the seven categories, the scan completion time, coverage and precision flags, and the record format and rules version numbers. No paths, file names, directory names, app names, or file lists are stored; nothing is sent over the network or uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "變化記錄只保存在本機 App 自身的 Application Support 目錄，包含：加鹽後的匿名範圍識別碼、七個類別各自的容量與條目數、掃描完成時間、涵蓋與精確度標誌、記錄格式與規則版本號。不保存任何路徑、檔案名稱、目錄名稱、App 名稱或檔案清單；不連接網路、不上傳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "口径：已扫描类别的分配大小统计": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Basis: allocated-size totals for scanned categories"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "口徑：已掃描類別的分配大小統計"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另一项忽略列表变更仍在保存，请稍后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another ignore-list change is still being saved. Try again later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
