            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一項忽略列表變更仍在儲存，請稍後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只从当前会话的范围配置中移除，不会访问或删除目录内容": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove the scope from this session's configuration only; directory contents are not accessed or deleted"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅從目前會話的範圍設定中移除，不會存取或刪除目錄內容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只保存在本机，不写入任何网络端点；当前 %@ 个采样点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
