            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Available storage has stayed below 10% for 10 minutes. Review the statistics in Space Cleanup before deciding whether to act."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可用容量低於 10% 已持續 10 分鐘。可在「空間清理」查看統計資料後，再決定是否處理。"
          }
