          }
        }
      }
    },
    "各类别统计与上次可比扫描持平，未发现增长或缩小的类别。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Category statistics are unchanged from the last comparable scan; no growing or shrinking categories were found."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各類別統計與上次可比掃描持平，未發現成長或縮小的類別。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "各项目容量沿既有分配大小口径；跨目录逐文件硬链接不在本版去重能力内，未检出时不作额外扣减。只读关联项目只显示数量与证据，不显示容量。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item sizes follow the existing allocated-size basis; per-file hard links across directories are beyond this version's deduplication capability, and no additional deduction is made when they are not detected. Read-only associated items show only counts and evidence, not sizes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各項目容量沿既有分配大小口徑；跨目錄逐檔案硬連結不在本版去重能力內，未檢出時不作額外扣減。只讀關聯項目只顯示數量與證據，不顯示容量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合计已确定性去重：排除 %@ 项（重复路径、同一文件身份或父子路径）；详见「依据与限制」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Total deterministically deduplicated: excluded item count %@ (duplicate paths, identical file identity, or parent-child paths); see \"Basis and Limitations\" for details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計已確定性去重：排除 %@ 項（重複路徑、同一檔案身份或父子路徑）；詳見「依據與限制」。"
