    },
    "在终端对运行中的应用执行 `lsof -a -p <进程号> -i`，输出应为空；或在源码中检索网络接口名，命中应为 0。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run `lsof -a -p <process ID> -i` on the running app in Terminal; the output should be empty. You can also search the source for network API names and confirm zero matches."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「終端機」對執行中的 App 執行 `lsof -a -p <程序 ID> -i`，輸出應為空；或在原始碼中搜尋網路 API 名稱，應無搜尋結果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
