    "复查不完整：%@ 个范围未能核对（不可读、超时、取消或策略跳过）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recheck incomplete: scopes not checked: %@ (unreadable, timed out, cancelled, or skipped by policy)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "複查不完整：有 %@ 個範圍未能檢查（無法讀取、逾時、取消或依規則略過）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复查不完整：原卸载身份的 Bundle Identifier 已不可用，无法安全重跑精确规则。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recheck Incomplete: the original Bundle Identifier is unavailable, so the exact rules cannot be rerun safely."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "複查不完整：原解除安裝身分的 Bundle Identifier 已無法使用，無法安全重新執行精確規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复查发现的项目不会自动勾选、不会进入新的执行计划；可在重新扫描后自行审阅勾选，或在 Finder 中查看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Items found by the recheck are not automatically selected and do not enter a new execution plan; you can review and select them yourself after rescanning, or view them in Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "複查發現的項目不會自動勾選、不會進入新的執行計畫；可在重新掃描後自行審閱勾選，或在 Finder 中查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复查发现项目合计 %@。该数字与本次卸载已移入废纸篓的%@是两套独立数字，互不对账。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Items found by the recheck total %@. This figure and the %@ moved to Trash in this uninstall are two independent figures and are not reconciled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "複查發現項目合計 %@。該數字與本次解除安裝已移到垃圾桶的%@是兩套獨立數字，互不對賬。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复查对象：%@（%@）；复查于 %@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
