          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用本体与应用数据建议通过应用自身的卸载或设置管理。此处只做容量归类，不建议手动处理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manage app bundles and app data through the original app's uninstaller or settings. This section only categorizes their size and does not recommend manual handling."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 本體與 App 資料建議透過App 本身的解除安裝或設定管理。此處只做容量歸類，不建議手動處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用本体失败时，全部残留必须保持不动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the app bundle fails, all leftovers must remain untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App本體失敗時，全部殘留必須保持不動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用本体已保留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Bundle Kept"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 本體已保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用本体已移入废纸篓。可以按卸载时冻结的应用身份重新核对九条精确路径与只读关联位置；复查只读，不会移动任何文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app bundle has been moved to Trash. You can recheck the nine exact paths and read-only associated locations using the app identity frozen at uninstall time; the recheck is read-only and will not move any files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 本體已移到垃圾桶。可以按解除安裝時凍結的 App 身份重新核對九條精確路徑與只讀關聯位置；複查只讀，不會移動任何檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用本体必须最先处理并成功，之后才允许处理残留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app bundle must be processed first and succeed before any leftovers may be processed"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App本體必須最先處理並成功，之後才允許處理殘留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用本体未成功移入废纸篓，按照卸载边界，本残留保持不动且未执行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app bundle was not moved to the Trash. Under the uninstall boundary, this leftover was left untouched and not run."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 本體未成功移到垃圾桶；依解除安裝界限，此殘留項目保持不動且未執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
