    "所属扫描范围仍在进行，结果尚未冻结。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The related scan scope is still in progress; results are not yet final."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所屬掃描範圍仍在進行，結果尚未凍結。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所属扫描范围因记录的安全或策略限制被跳过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The related scan scope was skipped for a recorded safety or policy restriction."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所屬掃描範圍因記錄的安全或策略限制被跳過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所属扫描范围在完成前被取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The related scan scope was canceled before completion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所屬掃描範圍在完成前被取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所属扫描范围存在覆盖缺口；这不表示当前候选本身未被读取。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The related scan scope has a coverage gap; this does not mean the current candidate was not read."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所屬掃描範圍存在覆蓋缺口；這不表示目前候選本身未被讀取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所属扫描范围存在覆盖缺口；这不表示当前项目本身未被读取。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The related scan scope has a coverage gap; this does not mean the current item was not read."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所屬掃描範圍存在覆蓋缺口；這不表示目前項目本身未被讀取。"
          }
