            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所屬掃描範圍已完整結束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所属扫描范围无法访问，请根据结构化问题处理后重新扫描。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The related scan scope is inaccessible. Address its structured issues, then rescan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所屬掃描範圍無法存取，請根據結構化問題處理後重新掃描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所属扫描范围没有纳入本轮扫描。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The related scan scope was not included in this scan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所屬掃描範圍沒有納入本輪掃描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所有成功项目只移入废纸篓，没有永久删除；可在 Finder 的废纸篓中恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All successful items are only moved to the Trash, not permanently deleted; you can restore them from the Trash in Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有成功項目只移到垃圾桶，沒有永久刪除；可在 Finder 的垃圾桶中回復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所有数据都在本机处理，不上传、不联网。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All data is processed on this Mac; it is not uploaded or sent over the network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有資料都在本機處理，不會上傳或連線傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所有残留默认关闭": {
