    },
    "无法加入“%@”：已选子范围“%@”与其冲突。请先移除子范围，再添加父范围。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot add “%@”: it conflicts with the selected child scope “%@”. Remove the child scope before adding its parent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法加入「%@」：與已選取的子範圍「%@」衝突。請先移除子範圍，再加入父範圍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法加入“%@”：已选父范围“%@”将覆盖此目录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot add “%@”: the selected parent scope “%@” already covers this directory."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法加入「%@」：已選取的父範圍「%@」已涵蓋此目錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法加入“%@”：当前无法读取并进入此目录入口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot add “%@”: this directory entry cannot currently be read or entered."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法加入「%@」：目前無法讀取或進入此目錄入口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法加入“%@”：所选项目不是目录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot add “%@”: the selected item is not a directory."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法加入「%@」：選取的項目不是目錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法加入“%@”：目录入口不存在。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot add “%@”: the directory entry does not exist."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法加入「%@」：目錄入口不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法加入“%@”：目录入口本身是符号链接；Sin Clean 不会解析到其目标位置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot add “%@”: the directory entry itself is a symbolic link; Sin Clean does not follow it to its target."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法加入「%@」：目錄入口本身是符號連結；Sin Clean 不會沿著連結前往目標位置。"
          }
        }
