          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本区不提供永久删除，也不会自动移动任何文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This area does not offer permanent deletion and never moves files automatically"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本區不提供永久刪除，也不會自動移動任何檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地处理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local Processing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機處理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地最多保留最近 30 条成功扫描记录，且不超过 90 天；超出时在下次成功记录时按最旧优先确定性淘汰。关闭记录只停止新增、不删除既有记录；可在设置的「空间变化记录」中一次性清除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At most the 30 most recent successful scan records are kept locally, for no more than 90 days; beyond that, the oldest are deterministically evicted first when the next successful record is saved. Turning off recording only stops new records from being added and does not delete existing ones; you can clear them all at once under “Space Change Records” in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機最多保留最近 30 條成功掃描記錄，且不超過 90 天；超出時會在下次成功記錄時按最舊優先確定性淘汰。關閉記錄只停止新增、不刪除既有記錄；可在設定的「空間變化記錄」中一次清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地随机盐缺失，无法核对范围可比性。记录文件已保留；可在设置的「空间变化记录」中确认清除后重新开始。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local random salt is missing, so scope comparability cannot be checked. The record file is preserved. Confirm clearing it under Space Change History in Settings to start over."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地隨機鹽缺失，無法核對範圍可比性。記錄檔案已保留；可在設定的「空間變化記錄」中確認清除後重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地随机盐缺失，无法核对范围可比性；记录文件已保留，可在确认后清除并重新开始。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local random salt is missing, so scope comparability cannot be checked. The record file is preserved; confirm clearing it to start over."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機隨機鹽遺失，無法檢查範圍是否可比。記錄檔案已保留；確認後可清除並重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用涉及两项可选权限：读取受保护目录、发送提醒。它们都只在您执行相关操作时才申请，说明会写明为什么需要、用来做什么、不做会怎样；被拒绝时其余功能照常可用。本引导不会申请任何权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app has two optional permissions: reading protected directories and sending notifications. Each is requested only when you perform the related action, with an explanation of why it is needed, how it is used, and what happens if you decline. Other features remain available if you decline. This introduction requests no permissions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本 App 涉及兩項可選權限：讀取受保護目錄與傳送通知。只有在您執行相關操作時才會要求權限，並說明需要權限的原因、用途及拒絕後的影響；即使拒絕，其餘功能仍可使用。本引導不會要求任何權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本引导不会申请任何权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This onboarding will not request any permissions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本導覽不會要求任何權限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本引导只作说明，不会申请任何权限。": {
