          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Main destinations of the size checked this time, top %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次已檢查容量的主要去向，前 %@ 項"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次或基准扫描存在未统计目录，覆盖范围不一致，暂不可比较。本次与基准都完整读取后才能公平比较。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan or the baseline excluded directories, so coverage differs and comparison is unavailable. Both scans must read their full scopes for a fair comparison."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次或基準掃描存在未統計目錄，涵蓋範圍不一致，暫不可比較。本次與基準都完整讀取後才能公平比較。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次执行已取消：以下为已发生的部分结果。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This execution was canceled: the partial results that already occurred are shown below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次執行已取消：以下為已發生的部分結果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描已取消，以下为已扫描部分的诊断": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan was cancelled; the following diagnosis covers only the scanned portion"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描已取消，以下為已掃描部分的診斷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描已取消，以下为部分数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan was cancelled; the following results are partial"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描已取消，以下為部分資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描已取消，未生成完整结果，因此暂不与历史比较。完成一次扫描后再查看变化。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan was cancelled before a complete result was produced. Finish a scan to review changes against history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描已取消，未生成完整結果，因此暫不與歷史比較。完成一次掃描後再查看變化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描已统计总量": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Total Size Counted in This Scan"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描已統計總量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描未完成，%@ 个目录未能完成统计；重新扫描可获得完整覆盖情况。回到本应用时会自动重新检测权限状态（也可点「%@」）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan did not finish; %@ directories could not be fully counted. Scan again for complete coverage. Returning to this app re-checks permission status automatically (or select “%@”)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描未完成，%@ 個目錄未能完成統計；重新掃描可獲得完整覆蓋情況。回到本應用時會自動重新檢測權限狀態（也可點「%@」）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描未完成；重新扫描可获得完整覆盖情况。回到本应用时会自动重新检测权限状态（也可点「%@」）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan did not finish; scan again for complete coverage. Returning to this app re-checks permission status automatically (or select “%@”)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描未完成；重新掃描可獲得完整覆蓋情況。回到本應用時會自動重新檢測權限狀態（也可點「%@」）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描没有统计到任何字节总量，因此无法给出占用来源结论。可以检查所选范围后重新扫描。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan counted no bytes, so it cannot identify storage sources. Check the selected scopes and scan again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描沒有統計到任何字節總量，因此無法給出佔用來源結論。可以檢查所選範圍後重新掃描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描结果未通过数据一致性校验，为避免误导，暂不与历史比较。可以重新扫描后再看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan failed a data consistency check. Comparison with history is withheld to avoid misleading results. Scan again to retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描結果未透過資料一致性校驗，為避免誤導，暫不與歷史比較。可以重新掃描後再看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫描范围与最近一次记录的范围不同，直接比较会误导。用同一范围组合再扫描一次即可比较。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This scan used different scopes than the latest record, so a direct comparison would be misleading. Scan the same scope set again to compare."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次掃描範圍與最近一次記錄的範圍不同，直接比較會誤導。用同一範圍組合再掃描一次即可比較。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次方案：应用本体 + %@ 项残留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This plan: app bundle + selected leftover count %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次方案：App 本體 + %@ 項殘留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次有 %@ 个云端占位条目按当前占用计入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud placeholder entries counted at their current usage in this scan: %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次有 %@ 個雲端佔位條目按目前佔用計入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次结果已完成，但清理记录未能保存：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The result is complete, but the cleanup record could not be saved: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次結果已完成，但清理記錄未能儲存：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次结果未能写入本地记录（写入失败），因此暂无可靠的对比基准。下次成功扫描后会自动恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This result could not be written to the local record, so there is no reliable comparison baseline. Recording resumes after the next successful scan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次結果未能寫入本地記錄（寫入失敗），因此暫無可靠的對比基準。下次成功掃描後會自動回復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次范围组合的第一次成功扫描将作为起点记录；完成下一次同范围扫描后，这里会显示各类别的增减。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first successful scan of this scope set becomes the baseline. After another scan of the same scope set, category changes will appear here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次範圍組合的第一次成功掃描將作為起點記錄；完成下一次同範圍掃描後，這裡會顯示各類別的增減。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本流程不会处理此项目": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This process does not handle this item"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本流程不會處理此項目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本版本声明的扫描范围：本轮应用发现范围、九条精确 Bundle Identifier 残留路径、只读关联六类位置（关联分析开启时）。完整检查仅指上述范围的核对完整，不代表整台 Mac 上绝无其他文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan scope declared for this version: this round's app discovery scope, nine exact Bundle Identifier leftover paths, and six read-only associated location types (when association analysis is enabled). A complete check only means the above scope was fully checked; it does not mean no other files exist anywhere on the Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本版本聲明的掃描範圍：本輪 App 發現範圍、九條精確 Bundle Identifier 殘留路徑、只讀關聯六類位置（關聯分析開啟時）。完整檢查僅指上述範圍的核對完整，不代表整台 Mac 上絕無其他檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本类别固定路径与 Bundle Identifier 精确匹配，目标为普通文件或目录；未据此判断内容或独占所有权。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This category's fixed path exactly matches the Bundle Identifier and points to a regular file or directory; content and exclusive ownership were not inferred."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此類別的固定路徑與 Bundle Identifier 精確相符，目標為普通檔案或目錄；不據此判斷內容或獨占擁有權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本类别没有可供逐项检查的候选。": {
