    "此操作不可撤销。清除后将从下一次成功扫描重新开始记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This cannot be undone. Recording will start over from the next successful scan after clearing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作無法還原。清除後將從下一次成功掃描重新開始記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作只删除 Sin Clean 本机保存的历史摘要与只读详情，不会移动或删除废纸篓中的文件。取消或按 Escape 不会改变任何记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This action only deletes the history summaries and read-only details saved locally by Sin Clean; it does not move or delete files in the Trash. Canceling or pressing Escape does not change any records."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作只刪除 Sin Clean 本機儲存的歷史摘要與唯讀詳情，不會移動或刪除垃圾桶中的檔案。取消或按 Escape 不會改變任何記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此更新要求 macOS %@ 或更高版本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
