    "空间分析": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space Analysis"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空間分析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空间分析保持为空，也不会自动选择个人文件夹或打开目录面板。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space analysis stays empty; no personal folder is selected and no directory panel opens automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空間分析保持為空，也不會自動選擇個人資料夾或打開目錄面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空间分析只读取所选范围内的目录与文件元数据，用于展示目录树、容量条与大文件列表。本轮不移动、不删除、不修改任何文件，也不接入 Quick Look、Finder 或废纸篓。硬链接按 (设备号, inode) 去重后为精确值；APFS 克隆无法通过公开接口查询，故容量为上界；云端占位显示为当前占用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space Analysis only reads directory and file metadata in the selected scopes to show the directory tree, size bars, and large-file list. This run does not move, delete, or modify files, and does not use Quick Look, Finder, or Trash. Hard links are deduplicated by device ID and inode for an exact total. APFS clones cannot be queried through public APIs, so size is an upper bound. Cloud placeholders show their current usage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空間分析只讀取所選範圍內的目錄與檔案元資料，用於展示目錄樹、容量條與大型檔案列表。本輪不移動、不刪除、不修改任何檔案，也不接入 Quick Look、Finder 或垃圾桶。硬連結按 (裝置號, inode) 去重後為精確值；APFS 克隆無法透過公開介面查詢，故容量為上限；雲端佔位顯示為目前佔用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空间分析扫描进行中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space Analysis scan in progress"
