          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空间变化记录已关闭：本次及后续扫描不再写入，已保留的 %@ 条记录不会被删除。重新开启后，从下一次成功扫描开始恢复记录与比较。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space Change recording is off: this and later scans are not added to history. Retained records remain: %@. Once re-enabled, recording and comparison resume after the next successful scan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空間變化記錄已關閉：本次及後續掃描不再寫入，已保留的 %@ 筆記錄不會刪除。重新開啟後，從下一次成功掃描起回復記錄與比較。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空间变化记录文件无法读取或校验失败。原文件已保留、不会被清除；可在设置的「空间变化记录」中确认清除后重新开始。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Space Change record file cannot be read or failed validation. The original file is preserved. Confirm clearing it under Space Change History in Settings to start over."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空間變化記錄檔案無法讀取或校驗失敗。原檔案已保留、不會被清除；可在設定的「空間變化記錄」中確認清除後重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空间变化记录由更新版本的 Sin Clean 生成，本版本无法安全读取。原文件已保留；如需在本版本继续记录，可在设置中确认清除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Space Change record was created by a newer version of Sin Clean and cannot be safely read by this version. The original file is preserved. To continue recording with this version, confirm clearing it in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空間變化記錄由更新版本的 Sin Clean 生成，本版本無法安全讀取。原檔案已保留；如需在本版本繼續記錄，可在設定中確認清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
