          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统健康趋势保存在应用自身的 Application Support 目录；设置页可一键清空，清空后采样点数为 0。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System health trends are stored in the app's Application Support directory. Settings can clear them; the sample count is zero afterward."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統健康趨勢儲存在 App 自身的 Application Support 目錄；可在設定中一鍵清空，清空後取樣點數為 0。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统内存压力偏高已持续 3 分钟。可在「Mac 状态」证据卡查看判断依据与建议。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System memory pressure has stayed elevated for 3 minutes. Review the basis and suggestions in the Mac Status evidence card."
          }
