    "统一查看磁盘清理与应用卸载的完成记录。历史只用于审阅，不能据此执行任何操作或恢复旧选择。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review completed disk cleanup and app uninstall records in one place. History is for review only and cannot execute operations or restore old selections."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "集中查看磁碟清理與 App 解除安裝的完成記錄。歷史記錄僅供審閱，不能據此執行任何操作或還原舊選擇。"
          }
