    "自动（自适应）：跟随系统状态调整，前台基础 5 秒；固定档作为基础间隔，在后台、锁屏、低电量或扫描时仍会进一步放宽。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic (Adaptive): follows the system state, with a 5-second base interval in the foreground; fixed tiers serve as the base interval and are further relaxed in the background, on the lock screen, on low battery, or while scanning."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動（自適應）：跟隨系統狀態調整，前景基礎 5 秒；固定檔作為基礎間隔，在背景、鎖定螢幕、低電量或掃描時仍會進一步放寬。"
          }
        }
      }
