            "value": "Warning: Coverage for this scope is incomplete or unfinished. Unreadable, skipped, cancelled, and unscanned areas must not be interpreted as zero results."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告：此範圍的 Coverage 不完整或尚未完成；不可將無法讀取、跳過、取消或未掃描的範圍解讀為零結果。"
