    "选择范围后开始扫描，结果只保存在当前会话中；本轮不会移动、删除或修改任何文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select scopes and start scanning. Results are kept only in the current session; no files will be moved, deleted, or modified in this round."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇範圍後開始掃描，結果只保存在目前工作階段中；本輪不會移動、刪除或修改任何檔案。"
