    "除您主动点按「检查更新…」（获取更新清单）与确认后的「下载并安装」（下载更新包）两处、且仅连接 blacstar7.github.io 外，应用进程没有任何网络套接字；网络接口调用只存在于更新下载实现文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Except when you click “Check for Updates…” (fetching the update manifest) and after your confirmation “Download and Install” (downloading the update package)—connecting only to blacstar7.github.io—the app process has no network sockets; network API calls exist only in the update download implementation file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除您主動點按「檢查更新…」（取得更新清單）與確認後的「下載並安裝」（下載更新套件）兩處、且僅連線 blacstar7.github.io 外，應用程式處理序沒有任何網路插槽；網路介面呼叫只存在於更新下載實作檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
