    "验证入口投递（仅调试构建）：此通知由人工注入产生，用于验证生产投递路径；不改变任何判定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verification entry delivery (debug builds only): this notification was injected manually to verify the production delivery path; no judgement is changed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證入口投遞（僅調試構建）：此通知由人工注入產生，用於驗證生產投遞路徑；不改變任何判定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "高亮用于查看证据，勾选才会进入清理确认；两者互不改变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Highlighting is for viewing evidence; only checking enters a candidate into cleanup confirmation. The two do not affect each other."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高亮用於查看證據，勾選才會進入清理確認；兩者互不改變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认不勾选。可整类选择，也可进入逐项复核。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing is checked by default. Select an entire category, or review item by item."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設不勾選。可整類選擇，也可進入逐項複核。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认不勾选，清理可恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing Preselected; Cleanup Is Recoverable"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設不勾選，清理可回復"
          }
        }
      }
    },
