      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing Preselected"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設不選取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认不选；勾选后会在确认卸载且执行复验通过时随应用本体移到废纸篓": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not selected by default; when checked, it moves to the Trash with the app bundle after you confirm uninstall and the execution recheck passes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設不選；勾選後會在確認解除安裝且執行複驗通過時隨 App 本體移到垃圾桶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认关闭；开启后只依据持续状态触发，系统不会静默关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default; once enabled, reminders trigger only from sustained states, and the system won't silently turn them off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設關閉；開啟後僅依持續狀態觸發，系統不會靜默關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
